  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Wind-powered Pumping Station - Wind Pump. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the Wind-powered Pumping Station - Wind Pump on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>Wind-powered Pumping Station - Wind Pump</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<!--Overview部分（无需改动）-->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<!--创作者计划注释（无需改动）-->\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\">To download the model files please visit the <strong>Wind-powered Pumping Station - Wind Pump</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/2680429-wind-powered-pumping-station-wind-pump?from=search#profileId-2968456\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">MakerWorld</span></strong></span></a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">In The Box</h2>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 95px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"../../products/silicone-tube?skr=yes&amp;id=42952361934984&amp;modelId=2680429\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">Silicone Tube 3x5mm Transparent 2m (1PCS) - RC021</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"../../products/ptfe-tubes?skr=yes&amp;id=723049025637523605&amp;modelId=2680429\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\"> PTFE Tube (530mm*2PCS + 30mm*2PCS)</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"../../products/micro-steel-deep-groove-ball-bearings?skr=yes&amp;id=42504744960136&amp;modelId=2680429\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">Micro Steel Deep Groove Ball Bearing MR128ZZ (6PCS) - EA004</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"../../products/micro-steel-deep-groove-ball-bearings?skr=yes&amp;id=42504744566920&amp;modelId=2680429\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">Micro Steel Deep Groove Ball Bearing MR85ZZ (6PCS) - EA013</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"../../products/bt2-5-button-head-cap-self-tapping-screw-bhcs?skr=yes&amp;id=42382283210888&amp;modelId=2680429\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">BT2.5x8 BHCS Self Tapping Screw (20PCS) - AA136</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
